194 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(November has arrived, bringing darker evenings, chilly mornings and that familiar feeling that winter is just around the corner. I think we\220ll soon be reaching for the heating switches!)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

195 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(I\220m really settling into my new role as editor and thoroughly enjoying discovering more about the people, groups and organisations that bring  Leeds and Broomfield to life.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

196 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(I recently had a wonderful chat with Derek from Broomfield, hearing all about his life and many years of history in the village. It\220s fascinating to learn about the people and stories that make our villages so special.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

197 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(I love the excitement of Bonfire Night, although my dog definitely doesn\220t share my enthusiasm! The loud bangs can be frightening for our pets, so let\220s remember our four-legged friends and make sure they\220re safe and settled.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

198 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(November is also a time for remembrance. Leeds and Broomfield Primary School will hold a Remembrance Assembly at St Nicholas Church, Leeds Village, on Friday 6th November at 9am.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

199 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(All welcome.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

200 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(The church is also being beautifully decorated with crocheted poppies, lovingly made by local craft groups and the children at our school \204 a wonderful example of our community coming together.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

201 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(Thank you to everyone who contributes articles, photographs, events and stories to the magazine. Please keep them coming! I'd also love to hear your thoughts on the magazine. What would you like to see more of, and is there anything you feel doesn't belong? Your feedback will help me make it as interesting and relevant as possible for everyone in our villages.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

202 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 106 0 R/E(So, grab a cuppa \(coffee in my case!\), settle down and enjoy this month\220s magazine. I hope you find something that makes you smile, brings back a memory or inspires you to discover something new on your doorstep.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

