228 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(November has always seemed to me a month that encourages us to slow down.The bright colours of autumn begin to fade, the evenings draw in, and many of the trees stand quietly, letting their leaves fall. Walking through the countryside at this time of year, it is hard not to notice the change. What was full and vibrant only a few weeks ago now appears bare and vulnerable.)/E(November has always seemed to me a month that encourages us to slow down.The bright colours of autumn begin to fade, the evenings draw in, and many of the trees stand quietly, letting their leaves fall. Walking through the countryside at this time of year, it is hard not to notice the change. What was full and vibrant only a few weeks ago now appears bare and vulnerable.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

229 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(Yet the trees are not dying. They are preparing.By letting go of their leaves, they conserve their strength for the winter months ahead. Beneath the surface, life continues unseen. The promise of spring is already there, hidden from view.I wonder if there is a lesson for us in that.)/E(Yet the trees are not dying. They are preparing.By letting go of their leaves, they conserve their strength for the winter months ahead. Beneath the surface, life continues unseen. The promise of spring is already there, hidden from view.I wonder if there is a lesson for us in that.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

230 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(All of us carry things that become burdens: worries about those we love, disappointments we cannot change, old hurts that are difficult to forgive, or regrets that still linger. We hold on to them because they feel familiar, even when they weigh us down.)/E(All of us carry things that become burdens: worries about those we love, disappointments we cannot change, old hurts that are difficult to forgive, or regrets that still linger. We hold on to them because they feel familiar, even when they weigh us down.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(Jesus often invited people to do something different. He encouraged them to place their trust in God and to bring their burdens to him. Sometimes faith is not about doing more; sometimes it is about learning to let go. Letting go of anxiety. Letting go of resentment. Letting go of the need to control everything ourselves.)/E(Jesus often invited people to do something different. He encouraged them to place their trust in God and to bring their burdens to him. Sometimes faith is not about doing more; sometimes it is about learning to let go. Letting go of anxiety. Letting go of resentment. Letting go of the need to control everything ourselves.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(November is also a month of remembrance. On Remembrance Sunday, we honour those who gave so much in the service of others.)/E(November is also a month of remembrance. On Remembrance Sunday, we honour those who gave so much in the service of others.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(Many of us will also think of family members and friends we have loved and lost. Their absence can still be keenly felt, especially as the year draws towards its end.)/E(Many of us will also think of family members and friends we have loved and lost. Their absence can still be keenly felt, especially as the year draws towards its end.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

234 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 108 0 R/T(Yet remembrance is not simply about looking backwards. It is also about gratitude. We give thanks for lives that touched ours, for sacrifices made on our behalf, and for love that continues to shape us even when someone is no longer physically present.)/E(Yet remembrance is not simply about looking backwards. It is also about gratitude. We give thanks for lives that touched ours, for sacrifices made on our behalf, and for love that continues to shape us even when someone is no longer physically present.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

