459 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(November always feels like a month of transformation at Leeds Castle. Autumn is still very much with us at the beginning of the month, with the last of the colour across the parkland and gardens, but behind the scenes the Estate is rapidly preparing for some of the busiest weeks of our year.)/E(November always feels like a month of transformation at Leeds Castle. Autumn is still very much with us at the beginning of the month, with the last of the colour across the parkland and gardens, but behind the scenes the Estate is rapidly preparing for some of the busiest weeks of our year.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

460 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(We begin the month with the final days of our Horrible Histories Halloween adventure, which has brought plenty of ghosts, gruesome stories and rather questionable medieval superstitions to the Estate over Half Term. )/E(We begin the month with the final days of our Horrible Histories Halloween adventure, which has brought plenty of ghosts, gruesome stories and rather questionable medieval superstitions to the Estate over Half Term. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

461 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(It also marks the end for now of Pilgrimage of Love, our exhibition exploring the remarkable life of Queen Eleanor of Castile. Since opening in March, it has been wonderful to see visitors discovering more about a woman whose story is so closely connected to Leeds Castle. So far, the Eleanor AI Avatar has answered over 41,000 visitor questions! Eleanor and her exhibition will return in the New Year. )/E(It also marks the end for now of Pilgrimage of Love, our exhibition exploring the remarkable life of Queen Eleanor of Castile. Since opening in March, it has been wonderful to see visitors discovering more about a woman whose story is so closely connected to Leeds Castle. So far, the Eleanor AI Avatar has answered over 41,000 visitor questions! Eleanor and her exhibition will return in the New Year. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

462 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(There is barely time to catch our breath before the Fireworks Spectacular returns on 7th and 8th November. This year's theme is TIME, with fireworks choreographed to music alongside projections and lasers transforming the Castle itself. )/E(There is barely time to catch our breath before the Fireworks Spectacular returns on 7th and 8th November. This year's theme is TIME, with fireworks choreographed to music alongside projections and lasers transforming the Castle itself. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

463 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(Fireworks weekend is always an extraordinary couple of days for the Estate and there is something very special about seeing thousands of people gathered together on the Castle lawns as darkness falls.)/E(Fireworks weekend is always an extraordinary couple of days for the Estate and there is something very special about seeing thousands of people gathered together on the Castle lawns as darkness falls.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

464 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(Once the final firework has disappeared, however, an entirely different transformation begins.)/E(Once the final firework has disappeared, however, an entirely different transformation begins.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

465 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(As I write this, preparations are well underway for the Christmas Castle Experience - Wallace & Gromit: A Cracking Christmas Caper. From 21 November, visitors will be recruited to Wallace and Gromit's Anti-Theft-O Security team to help investigate the mysterious disappearance of the Leeds Castle Diamond. )/E(As I write this, preparations are well underway for the Christmas Castle Experience - Wallace & Gromit: A Cracking Christmas Caper. From 21 November, visitors will be recruited to Wallace and Gromit's Anti-Theft-O Security team to help investigate the mysterious disappearance of the Leeds Castle Diamond. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

466 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(The adventure will take visitors through the Castle, encountering some familiar faces along the way, including Feathers McGraw, Shaun the Sheep and a few other suspicious characters.)/E(The adventure will take visitors through the Castle, encountering some familiar faces along the way, including Feathers McGraw, Shaun the Sheep and a few other suspicious characters.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

467 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(Creating Christmas at Leeds Castle is always a huge undertaking and much of the work happens when visitors have gone home. Rooms are transformed, decorations installed and countless finishing touches added before the doors open. After many months of planning, it is enormously exciting to finally see it all beginning to come together.)/E(Creating Christmas at Leeds Castle is always a huge undertaking and much of the work happens when visitors have gone home. Rooms are transformed, decorations installed and countless finishing touches added before the doors open. After many months of planning, it is enormously exciting to finally see it all beginning to come together.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

468 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(Christmas Lights also returns from 20 November, transforming the wider Estate after dark with illuminated installations, the Fire Garden, Christmas Cathedral and the spectacular fountain show. Father Christmas will also be back from 21 November, so by the end of the month there will be very little doubt that Christmas has arrived at Leeds Castle.)/E(Christmas Lights also returns from 20 November, transforming the wider Estate after dark with illuminated installations, the Fire Garden, Christmas Cathedral and the spectacular fountain show. Father Christmas will also be back from 21 November, so by the end of the month there will be very little doubt that Christmas has arrived at Leeds Castle.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

469 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 114 0 R/T(Before then, I hope you have the opportunity to enjoy the final weeks of autumn across the Estate. November may bring darker evenings and colder days, but there is certainly plenty happening behind the gates.)/E(Before then, I hope you have the opportunity to enjoy the final weeks of autumn across the Estate. November may bring darker evenings and colder days, but there is certainly plenty happening behind the gates.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

