2443 0 obj
<</Title(Christmas Lights also returns from 20 November, transforming the wider Estate after dark with illuminated installations, the Fire Garden, Christmas Cathedral and the spectacular fountain show. Father Christmas will also be back from 21 November, so by the end of the month there will be very little doubt that Christmas has arrived at Leeds Castle.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2445 0 R/Next 2441 0 R>>
endobj

2444 0 obj
<</Title(Peter Callway, Area Dean)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2442 0 R/Next 2446 0 R>>
endobj

2445 0 obj
<</Title(Creating Christmas at Leeds Castle is always a huge undertaking and much of the work happens when visitors have gone home. Rooms are transformed, decorations installed and countless finishing touches added before the doors open. After many months of planning, it is enormously exciting to finally see it all beginning to come together.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2447 0 R/Next 2443 0 R>>
endobj

