<</Title(It also marks the end for now of Pilgrimage of Love, our exhibition exploring the remarkable life of Queen Eleanor of Castile. Since opening in March, it has been wonderful to see visitors discovering more about a woman whose story is so closely connected to Leeds Castle. So far, the Eleanor AI Avatar has answered over 41,000 visitor questions! Eleanor and her exhibition will return in the New Year.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2464 0 R/Next 2455 0 R>>
